      <title>9月3日晚ChatGPT等四款AI工具集体故障，共享云基础设施成疑</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260903/9%E6%9C%883%E6%97%A5%E6%99%9AChatGPT%E7%AD%89%E5%9B%9B%E6%AC%BEAI%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E4%BA%91%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%88%90%E7%96%91/</link>
